2026-11-25 11:15  fw 1.1.7 -> 1.1.8  CYD sp500-32.local (192.168.1.161, chip F3AF48)  [espota over Wi-Fi, 67 s]
           Bollinger Bands on the LCD Market chart + candlesticks, driven by one new setting pair
           (bbLcd 0/1 default 0, bbLcdP 10/20/50 default 20, sigma fixed at 2.0).
           Firmware: settings keys validated with an allow-list ("bbLcdP must be 10, 20 or 50"), stored in
           config.json, reported in /api/settings limits; changing them calls UI::invalidateChart() (plot only,
           no full-screen flash). ChartData::bollinger() = sliding sum/sum-of-squares population SD, O(n),
           leading p-1 entries NaN. DisplayUI drawPlot(): period clamped to n/2 (1M stores only 24 daily bars),
           needs n>=6, y-range widened to fit the bands, dithered (checkerboard) band wash + solid upper/lower +
           dotted SMA + corner tag "BB <period used>". With bbLcd on, ranges whose bars carry a wick (h>l)
           are drawn as candlesticks instead of the line+fill; series with no wick keep the line.
           Web Settings tab: "BB + candles on the LCD chart" checkbox + SMA 10/20/50 select, applied
           immediately (partial POST), also part of the Save payload.
